{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"大角咀廟會　500呎LED夜光花式龍舞動\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/TKT-DRAGON-261101-22.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】大角咀廟會在福全街舉行。</p><p>這條五光十色的夜光龍，是全港最長、達500呎的炫彩LED夜光花式龍，聯同國家級非物質文化遺產沙頭角魚燈舞一起穿梭舞動，吸引不少市民和旅客觀賞。</p><p>大角咀廟會是第20屆舉行，全日舉辦多項活動，包括千人大巡遊以及盆菜宴等。大會指全日約有18萬人參加，未來會繼續傳承中華傳統文化。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:46.031938+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T14:25:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T08:58:11.296902+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:57.650631+00:00","content_hash":"ee1b170821aedb59868941e2d57873a0aa247f488dad80b6029115f30ef3d451","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:46.031938+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}